# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# This repository publishes the benchmark pipeline only (Code availability).
#
# The policy is deny-by-default: everything at the repository root is ignored,
# and only the pipeline code is re-included below. That keeps the 22 GB image
# dataset, the 6.5 GB of checkpoints, and the manuscript sources out of the
# repository by construction rather than by remembering to list them.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
/*

!/.gitignore
!/LICENSE
!/README.md
!/requirements.txt
!/rename_dataset.py
!/src/
!/configs/

# Weights referenced by configs/models.yaml, required to run the benchmark.
!/yolo26n-cls.pt

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Python
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Tooling and OS
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*~
